            "max_check_attempts": 5,
            "notes": "Lists where your own templates in the Icinga Director override the defaults of the Linuxfabrik templates: service templates that import a Linuxfabrik service template, directly or through further templates, and set variables of its check command to other values, and host templates whose service overrides apply to every host that imports them. For each override, the plugin shows the default it replaces. Overrides that no longer have an effect are listed separately: those for variables that the check command does not use (for example after a variable was renamed), those that merely repeat the default, and host template overrides for services that no host gets. Values of hidden or sensitive variables are masked. Overrides never cause an alert, as this is an inventory. Alerts only if the configuration of the Icinga Director cannot be read. Supports extended reporting via --lengthy.",
            "notes_url": "https://linuxfabrik.github.io/monitoring-plugins/check-plugins/icinga-director-template-overrides/",
